<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 32.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 32.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell by 124 basis points to 32.96 percent on Friday, from 34.20 percent on Thursday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is revised daily.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558</p>
</text>
